sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Host console
  participant B as Bail
  actor A as Attendee (in the call)
  participant W as Web app
  participant R as Relayer
  H->>B: open_slot(2, commitment to the code)
  H-->>A: shows "tiger maple seven ocean lamp" in the call
  A->>W: types the code
  W->>W: proof = hash of code and ticket key, sign
  W->>R: catch
  R->>B: catch(event, 2, attempt, pubkey, proof, sig)
  Note over B: inside the 120 s window, a higher attempt can fix a typo
  Note over H,B: after the window
  H->>B: reveal(2, code)
  Note over B: anyone who knows the code can reveal it
